Next Js da routing bolinadi ikkiga => APP routing & Pages routing
APP routing => by default SSR da quradi! Shuning uchun (useClient) kerak boladi, agar Client tomoni kerak bosa
APP routing bizga kerak emas chunki backend dan foydalanmiymiz!
Agar NextJS da backend & frontend quradigan bosak bizga APP routing kerak boladi!

NextJS afzalliklari :
    1. Rendering => SSR & CSR hosil qilinishi 
    SSR => og'ir mantiqlani buyerda tashkil qilganda, serverga yengillik beradi!
    CSR (Client Side Server Rendering) => hooks, clicks and etc.. (yengil mantiqla)

    2. SEO (Search Engine Optimization) mukammal tashkil qilish imkoni!
        bu SSR da qurilgani uchun tez uqiladi

    3. Routing system => Pages & APP

    4. Layout  => turli header & footer boganda layout bilan wrap qilamiz!

    5. Deploy mantiqlari automatic set up qilib beradi!

    6. Cashing Architecture => Frontend Architecture! bu malumotlani cashlash (datani togridan togri cashga yozish)
        cashga qachon data saqlash mumkin, qachonki frontenddan aniq va tiniq biz belgilagan malumot kelganda! (DTO & pipe validation)
        chunki backend himoyalangan boladi!
